  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 48 ÷ 16 × 24 - 5 + 3 = 12\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\n48 ÷ 16 × 24 - 5 + 3 = 12 ⇒ 48 × 16 ÷ 24 - 5 + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 48 × __**16 **____**÷**____** 24**__ - 5 + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ __**48 × 0.67**__ - 5 + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ __**32**____** + 3**__ - 5 = 12\n\n⇒ __**35**____** - 5**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 30 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and +\n\n48 ÷ 16 × 24 - 5 + 3 = 12 ⇒ 48 + 16 × 24 - 5 ÷ 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 48 + 16 × 24 - __**5 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 48 + __**16 × 24**__ - 1.67 = 12\n\n⇒ __**48 + 384**__ - 1.67 = 12\n\n⇒ __432** - 1.67**__ = 12\n\n⇒ 430.33 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − and ÷\n\n48 ÷ 16 × 24 - 5 + 3 = 12 ⇒ 48 - 16 × 24 ÷ 5 + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 48 - 16 × __**24 **____**÷**____** 5**__ + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 48 - __**16 × 4.8**__ + 3 = 12\n\n⇒ __**48 + 3**__ - 76.8 = 12\n\n⇒ __**51 - 76.8**__ = 12\n\n⇒ -25.8 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\n48 ÷ 16 × 24 - 5 + 3 = 12 ⇒ 48 ÷ 16 + 24 - 5 × 3 = 12\n\n⇒ __**48 ÷ 16**__ + 24 - 5 × 3 = 12\n\n⇒ 3 + 24 - __**5 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 12\n\n⇒ __**3 + 24**__ - 15 = 12\n\n⇒ __27** - 15**__ = 12\n\n**⇒ 12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
